MXLogger provides the CMake target MXLogger::Core:

    find_package(MXLoggerCore CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(your_app PRIVATE MXLogger::Core)

Use #include <mxlogger.hpp> and #include <mxlogger_util.hpp>.
This local overlay builds its enclosing source checkout; disable binary caching
and reinstall the port when testing changed source with the same version.
